{"id": 129, "name": "Zetian", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_8d965f05f84621a51f799aeb8fb5f4c4.png", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Damage", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["40", "70", "50", "20"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Recognized by the Heavens and cherished by her people, the Celestial Empress of the Cadia Riverlands ascends to bring peace to the mortal realm.", "skills": [{"name": "Celestial Armament", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_44934a50e133cbe0387d520f0eafd0bb.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Crown</span>: When Zetian hits enemy heroes with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Strike</span> or <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Descent</span>, she gains 1% Spell Vamp for 5s (up to 10 stacks).\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Celestial Robe</span>: The power of the Phoenix periodically protects Zetian, knocking back and stunning any enemy hero who approaches her, dealing 90(+10*Hero Level)<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>. She also gains a 300(+20*Hero Level)<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> shield for 3s. Cooldown: 120s."}, {"name": "Phoenix Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_d9814f641d7040f425863cbb9733ce57.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Zetian unleashes a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Wave</span> in the target direction. If it hits an enemy, she automatically casts another wave (up to 3 times). Zetian can cast other skills during this time.\n\nThe waves deal 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span>, 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span>, and 360<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+120% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>, respectively. The 3rd wave has a larger area and pulls enemies toward the cast direction (not considered a control effect).\n\nThe Spell Vamp ratio against minions is only 65%."}, {"name": "Phoenix Descent", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_174652aa9781ef344273263d39f6d5ed.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 15   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Zetian summons a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Spirit</span> at the target location, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+45% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and applying a brief 50% slow effect to enemies in the area. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Spirit</span> hovers at the location for 3s, dealing 20<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> every 0.5s and reducing enemies' Magic Defense by 10% while revealing their surrounding area.\nWhile the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Phoenix Spirit</span> is active, Zetian can use this skill again to command it to charge toward a designated location, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+45% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and applying a brief 50% slow effect upon arrival."}, {"name": "Fury of the Phoenix", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_1_9_90/100_c4ad79c62c6d69f54cae3baf2b8ac69d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 90   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Zetian calls upon her divine mandate and the hearts of her people, granting all allied heroes 40% Movement Speed that gradually decays over 3s, while bringing divine retribution upon all enemy heroes, dealing 400<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and stunning them for 0.8s. Zetian gains vision of all enemy heroes during this time.\nZetian can cast other skills while channeling this skill."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Magic Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_80a7900e7afd6a7f63384c781b043d33.png"}, {"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ff18dc8e5abef3934886191fe6c161a0.png"}, {"name": "Blood Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8635fde5353c9c68778e2aa59b931844.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}, {"name": "Wishing Lantern", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_6fda020574d0e7ad461b12c88d2730e5.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Mage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_c7febdebe70929be98c7007af3cd0f3a.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Inspire", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8d95d9a3bb304ebd45a08814b5c65434.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Wilderness Blessing", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4f6b378bdf1f7d9802387f44f37d7f04.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Impure Rage", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_30fc47f40c0ef7fb770d98d6f570f404.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Flicker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100